      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A method for evaluation of the physical load on the lumbar spine in industrial work is presented. It is suitable for identification of high spinal loads and their time duration. The method is based on biomechanical analysis of video-recordings. It takes into account the posture of the body as such, as well as the possible occurrence of external load and support. Compression of the L5-S1 intervertebral disc and strain on the lumbodorsal fascia is determined at 5-s intervals in each work task."},
